{"t":"EXPE","made":"2026-11-10 08:51","name":"Expedia Group, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Travel Services","employees":16000,"hq":"Seattle, WA, United States","website":"https://www.expediagroup.com","summary_en":"Expedia Group, Inc. operates as an online travel company in the United States and internationally. The company operates through B2C, B2B, and trivago segments. The B2C segment includes Brand Expedia, a full-service online travel brand offers various travel products and services; Hotels.com for lodging accommodations; Vrbo, an online marketplace for the alternative accommodations; and Orbitz, Travelocity, ebookers, and Wotif Group. The B2B segment provides various travel and non-travel companies including airlines, offline travel agents, online retailers, corporate travel management, and financial institutions who leverage its travel technology and tap into its diverse supply to augment their offerings and market Expedia Group rates and availabilities to its travelers. The trivago segment sends referrals to online travel companies and travel service providers from hotel metasearch websites. In addition, it provides brand advertising through online and offline channels, loyalty programs, mobile apps, and search engine marketing, as well as metasearch, social media, direct and personalized traveler communications on its websites, and through direct e-mail communication with its travelers. The company was formerly known as Expedia, Inc. and changed its name to Expedia Group, Inc. in March 2018. Expedia Group, Inc. was founded in 1996 and is headquartered in Seattle, Washington.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Expedia Group, Inc.는 미국 및 해외에서 온라인 여행사로 운영되고 있습니다. 이 회사는 B2C, B2B 및 트리바고 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. B2C 부문에는 다양한 여행 상품과 서비스를 제공하는 풀서비스 온라인 여행 브랜드인 Brand Expedia가 포함됩니다. 숙박시설을 찾으려면 Hotels.com을 이용하세요. 대체 숙박 시설을 위한 온라인 마켓플레이스인 Vrbo Orbitz, Travelocity, ebookers 및 Wotif Group이 있습니다. B2B 부문은 항공사, 오프라인 여행사, 온라인 소매업체, 기업 여행 관리 및 금융 기관을 포함한 다양한 여행 및 비여행 회사를 제공합니다. 이들은 여행 기술을 활용하고 다양한 공급을 활용하여 상품을 늘리고 Expedia Group의 요금 및 예약 가능 여부를 여행자에게 홍보합니다. 트리바고 부문은 호텔 메타 검색 웹사이트에서 온라인 여행사 및 여행 서비스 제공업체에 추천을 보냅니다. 또한 온라인 및 오프라인 채널, 로열티 프로그램, 모바일 앱, 검색 엔진 마케팅은 물론 메타 검색, 소셜 미디어, 웹사이트의 직접적이고 개인화된 여행자 커뮤니케이션, 여행자와의 직접적인 이메일 커뮤니케이션을 통해 브랜드 광고를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Expedia, Inc.로 알려졌으나 2018년 3월에 Expedia Group, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. Expedia Group, Inc.는 1996년에 설립되었으며 워싱턴 주 시애틀에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":259.16,"mcap":30729717760.0,"pe":15.191091,"fpe":10.459181,"peg":0.6806,"ps":1.8938566,"pb":18.612469,"ev_ebitda":10.247,"div":0.74,"beta":1.391,"hi52":342.0,"lo52":185.34},"fin":{"rev":16225999872.0,"rev_g":0.119,"eps_g":0.149,"gross":0.90478,"op":0.27825,"net":0.12985,"roe":0.76747,"fcf":2346500096.0,"cash":5567000064.0,"debt":5688999936.0,"de":195.096,"eps":17.06,"feps":24.77823},"own":{"short":0.0877,"inst":1.08406,"insider":0.00624},"analyst":{"n":35,"mean":333.14285,"median":330.0,"high":430.0,"low":235.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.18421,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":17,"hold":19,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":17,"hold":20,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":17,"hold":21,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":0,"buy":17,"hold":21,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-09","Firm":"Jefferies","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":325.0,"priorPriceTarget":350.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":330.0,"priorPriceTarget":345.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Susquehanna","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":310.0,"priorPriceTarget":315.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceT